WEBVTT

00:01.059 --> 00:03.956
<i>[upbeat jazzy music]</i>
<i>[欢快的爵士乐]</i>

00:04.025 --> 00:10.956
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:11.025 --> 00:13.404
♪ La-da-dee, la-da-da,
la-da-da ♪
♪ 拉-达-迪，拉-达-达，
啦啦啦啦♪

00:13.473 --> 00:14.749
<i>- [distant screaming]</i>
- Uh-oh.
<i>-[远处的尖叫声]</i>
- 呃哦。

00:14.818 --> 00:16.025
Incoming.
传入。

00:16.094 --> 00:17.956
Ahh!
啊！

00:18.025 --> 00:20.094
[groaning]
[呻吟]

00:20.163 --> 00:21.439
[laughs]
[笑]

00:21.508 --> 00:24.128
Plankton, you're a hot mess.
浮游生物，你真是一团糟。

00:24.197 --> 00:27.094
Serves ya right
fer tryin' to steal me formular
为你服务吧
fer试图偷走我的公式

00:27.163 --> 00:30.094
for the gazillionth time.
第无数次。

00:30.163 --> 00:32.197
I'll have my revenge!
我一定会报仇的！

00:32.266 --> 00:34.680
Mark my words!
记住我的话！

00:34.749 --> 00:36.611
- [laughs]
- Aw, come on.
- [笑]
- 噢，来吧。

00:36.680 --> 00:37.749
This isn't over!
这还没有结束！

00:37.818 --> 00:39.818
[grunts]
- Oh, hard day at work?
[咕哝]
- 哦，工作辛苦了一天吗？

00:39.887 --> 00:41.232
I know what you need.
我知道你需要什么。

00:41.301 --> 00:42.542
Ahh!
啊！

00:42.611 --> 00:43.818
[gasps]
[喘气]

00:43.887 --> 00:45.611
[sighs]
[叹气]

00:45.680 --> 00:46.818
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

00:46.887 --> 00:50.025
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

00:50.094 --> 00:55.404
Oh, Karen, I'm never gonna
get that Krabby Patty formula!
哦，凯伦，我永远不会
获取蟹黄派配方！

00:55.473 --> 00:57.128
[sniffles, grunts]
[抽鼻子，咕哝]

00:57.197 --> 00:59.439
Oops.
哎呀。

01:01.715 --> 01:05.266
Mmm, not bad.
嗯，不错。

01:05.335 --> 01:08.508
[laughter]
[笑声]

01:09.542 --> 01:12.404
Enjoy your molten face peels!
享受你融化的脸部换肤吧！

01:12.473 --> 01:14.266
<i>Holy clambake!</i>
<i>神圣的蛤蜊！</i>

01:14.335 --> 01:16.232
<i>Are Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy</i>
<i>是美人鱼男和藤壶男孩</i>

01:16.301 --> 01:19.956
<i>about to become hero flambé
cooked by Man Ray</i>
<i>即将成为英雄flambé
由曼·雷烹饪</i>

01:20.025 --> 01:22.335
<i>and his criminal posse
of E.V.I.L.?</i>
<i>和他的犯罪团伙
E.V.I.L.？</i>

01:22.404 --> 01:24.059
I hope so!
我希望如此！

01:24.128 --> 01:26.818
I love it when the villains
gain the upper hand.
我喜欢当坏人的时候
占据上风。

01:26.887 --> 01:28.059
[laughs]
[笑]

01:28.128 --> 01:31.232
<i>As our heroes face certain doom,</i>
<i>当我们的英雄面临某种厄运时，</i>

01:31.301 --> 01:32.887
<i>the villains escape</i>
<i>坏人逃脱</i>

01:32.956 --> 01:35.404
<i>to their secret
underground lair!</i>
<i>他们的秘密
地下巢穴！</i>

01:35.473 --> 01:36.404
[laughs]
[笑]

01:36.473 --> 01:37.853
Of course!
当然！

01:37.922 --> 01:39.335
All I need to do is
我需要做的就是

01:39.404 --> 01:41.128
join the criminals
of E.V.I.L.!
加入犯罪分子的行列
邪恶之徒！

01:41.197 --> 01:42.922
They'll help me defeat Krabs.
他们会帮助我打败蟹蟹。

01:42.991 --> 01:43.991
Smart thinking.
聪明的思维。

01:44.059 --> 01:46.611
You can go as "Towel Man."
你可以扮演“毛巾人”。

01:46.680 --> 01:48.611
Don't be a wisenheimer.
不要成为一个明智的人。

01:48.680 --> 01:51.197
I can't accessorize
this old rag.
我无法装饰
这块旧抹布。

01:51.266 --> 01:53.818
I need a real costume.
我需要一套真正的服装。

01:53.887 --> 01:56.163
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

01:56.232 --> 01:57.163
Eh?
呃？

01:57.232 --> 01:58.749
[buzzes]
[嗡嗡声]

01:58.818 --> 02:00.611
Aw.
噢。

02:00.680 --> 02:03.025
Ah!
啊!

02:03.094 --> 02:04.784
[hisses]
[嘶嘶声]

02:04.853 --> 02:06.094
[buzzes]
[嗡嗡声]

02:06.163 --> 02:08.370
[growls]
[咆哮]

02:08.439 --> 02:10.784
- [snarls]
- Ahh!
- [咆哮]
- 啊！

02:10.853 --> 02:12.335
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:12.404 --> 02:14.266
[laughs]
[笑]

02:14.335 --> 02:16.473
[dings]
[叮当声]

02:16.542 --> 02:17.956
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:18.025 --> 02:19.508
Maybe a shorter cape.
也许是更短的斗篷。

02:19.577 --> 02:22.439
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:22.508 --> 02:25.784
This must be the entrance
to their secret lair.
这应该是入口
到他们的秘密巢穴。

02:25.853 --> 02:28.680
A little dumpster dive,
and I'm in.
一个小小的垃圾箱潜水，
我进来了。

02:28.749 --> 02:29.956
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:30.025 --> 02:31.404
Ah.
啊。

02:31.473 --> 02:33.335
[straining]
[紧张]

02:33.404 --> 02:36.956
[groans]
Where's the door?
[呻吟]
门在哪里？

02:37.025 --> 02:38.991
Ooh?
哦？

02:39.059 --> 02:40.542
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:40.611 --> 02:43.059
Wrong dumpster.
错误的垃圾箱。

02:43.128 --> 02:45.853
[sighs]
Of course.
[叹气]
当然。

02:45.922 --> 02:47.335
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:47.404 --> 02:49.542
Hello?
[laughs]
你好？
[笑]

02:49.611 --> 02:52.266
I'm here
to join the forces of E.V.I.L.!
我在这里
加入 E.V.I.L. 的势力！

02:52.335 --> 02:57.059
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:57.128 --> 02:58.370
- Dude.
- Huh, wha...
- 伙计。
- 呃，什么...

02:58.439 --> 03:00.818
Sign in and wait your turn.
登录并等待轮到您。

03:00.887 --> 03:02.335
Red leather, yellow leather.
红色皮革，黄色皮革。

03:02.404 --> 03:04.439
Get out of the car, fellas!
下车吧，伙计们！

03:04.508 --> 03:06.148
Take all your money
and put it in the bag!
拿走你所有的钱
并把它放进包里！

03:06.197 --> 03:07.232
No, Mr. Bob.
不，鲍勃先生。

03:07.301 --> 03:09.301
I expect you to fry.
[cackles]
我期待着你去炒。
[咯咯笑]

03:09.370 --> 03:12.266
- When the full moon rises...
- I am the Strangler!
- 当满月升起时...
- 我是绞杀者！

03:12.335 --> 03:13.577
- [vocalizing]
- [clears throat]
- [发声]
- [清喉咙]

03:13.646 --> 03:16.508
I'm the Strangler.
- [growling]
我是绞杀者。
- [咆哮]

03:16.577 --> 03:18.715
- What is this yellow thing?
- [babbling]
- 这个黄色的东西是什么？
- [胡言乱语]

03:18.784 --> 03:20.197
Some kind of mold?
某种模具？

03:20.266 --> 03:23.128
To be or... line!
成为或...线！

03:23.197 --> 03:26.059
[growls, grunts]
Ha.
[咆哮，咕哝]
哈。

03:26.128 --> 03:28.335
[roars]
[怒吼]

03:28.404 --> 03:32.335
We've got quite an impressive
rogues gallery up there, eh?
我们有一个令人印象深刻的
那里有盗贼画廊，嗯？

03:32.404 --> 03:36.094
Thank you for taking time out
of your scandalous schedules
感谢您抽出时间
你可耻的日程安排

03:36.163 --> 03:38.128
to try out for E.V.I.L.
尝试 E.V.I.L.

03:38.197 --> 03:39.542
As you all know,
众所周知，

03:39.611 --> 03:41.473
we can only pick one new villain
我们只能选择一个新的反派

03:41.542 --> 03:42.991
to join Team E.V.I.L.,
加入E.V.I.L.团队，

03:43.059 --> 03:46.197
so let the judging begin!
那么让评判开始吧！

03:46.266 --> 03:47.887
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:47.956 --> 03:51.266
Eeny, meeny, miney... [grunts]
哎尼，米尼，我的……[咕哝]

03:51.335 --> 03:53.232
Nosferatu!
诺斯费拉图！

03:53.301 --> 03:55.266
[hissing]
[嘶嘶声]

03:55.335 --> 03:56.818
No way, Man Ray!
不可能，曼·雷！

03:56.887 --> 03:58.439
I was first!
我是第一个！

03:58.508 --> 04:01.094
First to go bye-bye.
[cackles]
首先要告别。
[咯咯笑]

04:01.163 --> 04:04.508
Huh?
[screams]
啊？
[尖叫声]

04:04.577 --> 04:06.335
[all gasp]
- Be gone!
[全都喘气]
- 走开！

04:06.404 --> 04:07.956
[blows]
[打击]

04:08.025 --> 04:10.025
Nosferatu, proceed.
诺斯费拉图，继续。

04:10.094 --> 04:10.991
<i>[eerie music]</i>
<i>[怪异音乐]</i>

04:11.059 --> 04:14.094
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:14.163 --> 04:17.059
[dramatic piano music]
[戏剧性的钢琴音乐]

04:17.128 --> 04:20.542
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:20.611 --> 04:22.163
Mime?
哑剧？

04:22.232 --> 04:24.335
Mime is his evil power?
哑剧是他的邪恶力量吗？

04:24.404 --> 04:27.404
Ahh!
啊！

04:27.473 --> 04:29.991
Robot Mantis!
机器人螳螂！

04:30.059 --> 04:31.473
[mumbles]
[咕哝]

04:31.542 --> 04:32.991
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

04:33.059 --> 04:36.715
[babbling]
[胡说]

04:36.784 --> 04:38.266
[somber cello music]
[忧郁的大提琴音乐]

04:38.335 --> 04:40.232
[babbling]
[胡说]

04:40.301 --> 04:41.887
[country violin music]
[乡村小提琴音乐]

04:41.956 --> 04:43.335
[babbling]
[胡说]

04:43.404 --> 04:44.577
[mellow banjo music]
[柔和的班卓琴音乐]

04:44.646 --> 04:46.335
[babbling]
[胡说]

04:46.404 --> 04:47.853
[upbeat kazoo music]
[欢快的卡祖笛音乐]

04:47.922 --> 04:49.473
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:49.542 --> 04:50.715
Ta-da!
哒哒！

04:50.784 --> 04:52.577
How dare you!
你怎么敢！

04:52.646 --> 04:54.991
We just had that piano tuned!
我们刚刚调好钢琴！

04:55.059 --> 04:58.163
Ahh!
啊！

04:59.232 --> 05:03.025
Eeny, meeny, miney... [grunts]
哎尼，米尼，我的……[咕哝]

05:03.094 --> 05:05.611
Sheldon J. Plankton?
谢尔顿·J·浮游生物？

05:05.680 --> 05:08.094
[dramatic kazoo music]
[戏剧性的卡祖笛音乐]

05:08.163 --> 05:12.749
Thanks, ma'am, but, uh,
music won't be necessary.
谢谢，女士，但是，呃，
音乐将不再是必需的。

05:12.818 --> 05:14.680
[grunts]
- Right.
[咕哝]
- 对。

05:14.749 --> 05:17.922
So what's your supervillain
power, little guy?
那么你的超级恶棍是什么
力量，小家伙？

05:17.991 --> 05:20.577
Well, I'd venture to say
好吧，我斗胆说

05:20.646 --> 05:24.646
it would be my massive,
evil intellect.
这将是我的巨大，
邪恶的智力。

05:24.715 --> 05:26.163
Impressive.
感人的。

05:26.232 --> 05:29.473
So where do you see yourself
in the next five years?
那么你在哪里看到自己
未来五年？

05:29.542 --> 05:33.197
Well, once I finally have
the secret formula...
好吧，一旦我终于拥有了
秘密公式...

05:33.266 --> 05:34.370
<i>[crowd screaming]</i>
<i>[人群尖叫]</i>

05:34.439 --> 05:36.715
The post-apocalyptic
global empire
后世界末日
全球帝国

05:36.784 --> 05:40.266
of destruction
that results will be mine,
破坏的
结果将是我的，

05:40.335 --> 05:44.404
and I'll be sitting pretty
on a pile of your bones!
我会坐得很漂亮
在你的一堆骨头上！

05:44.473 --> 05:45.991
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

05:46.059 --> 05:47.991
That sounds pretty villainous.
这听起来很邪恶。

05:48.059 --> 05:50.956
Okay, you'll move on
to the test phase.
好的，你会继续前进
到测试阶段。

05:51.025 --> 05:54.508
But first, you'll need
a proper supervillain name.
但首先，你需要
一个合适的超级恶棍的名字。

05:54.577 --> 05:57.128
How about "Mr. Green Bean"?
《绿豆先生》怎么样？

05:57.197 --> 06:00.887
Ooh,
the "Itsy Bitsy Green Guy."
哦，
“Itsy Bitsy Green Guy”。

06:00.956 --> 06:02.439
No, too long. <i>
[bell dings]</i>
不，太长了。 <我>
[铃声]</i>

06:02.508 --> 06:04.887
How about "Captain Pipsqueak"?
《皮普船长》怎么样？

06:04.956 --> 06:06.542
- Yeah!
- I love it!
- 是的！
- 我喜欢它！

06:06.611 --> 06:08.266
[laughter]
- That settles it.
[笑声]
=> - 这就解决了。

06:08.335 --> 06:09.991
Captain Pipsqueak!
皮普斯奎克船长！

06:10.059 --> 06:12.611
all: Captain Pipsqueak!
全体：皮普斯奎克船长！

06:12.680 --> 06:14.956
We can tweak that later, right?
我们可以稍后调整，对吗？

06:15.025 --> 06:16.370
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:16.439 --> 06:19.853
Okay, team, let's test
Captain Pipsqueak's villainy
好的，团队，让我们测试一下
皮普斯奎克船长的恶行

06:19.922 --> 06:21.577
in the real world.
在现实世界中。

06:21.646 --> 06:24.784
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

06:24.853 --> 06:27.542
Your first test is
to get us lunch:
你的第一个测试是
为我们准备午餐：

06:27.611 --> 06:31.784
a 25-pound bucket
from Weenie Hut Jr.
25磅重的水桶
来自 小威尼小屋

06:31.853 --> 06:34.542
[cackles]
- With Evil sauce.
[咯咯笑]
- 配上邪恶的酱汁。

06:34.611 --> 06:37.611
Extra Evil sauce.
[laughs]
额外的邪恶酱。
[笑]

06:37.680 --> 06:40.887
Odd caper, but no problemo.
奇怪的举动，但没问题。

06:40.956 --> 06:42.335
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:42.404 --> 06:43.715
[bell dinging]
[铃声]

06:43.784 --> 06:46.680
I need a 25-pound
Weenie bucket, please,
我需要一个25磅的
维尼桶，拜托，

06:46.749 --> 06:48.887
and make it snappy!
并让它变得敏捷！

06:48.956 --> 06:51.784
Oh, and extra Evil sauce.
哦，还有额外的邪恶酱。

06:51.853 --> 06:54.266
Hey, I know that order.
嘿，我知道这个顺序。

06:54.335 --> 06:56.473
You're one
of those E.V.I.L. guys.
你是一个
那些 E.V.I.L.伙计们。

06:56.542 --> 06:58.611
You're all banned!
你们都被禁止了！

06:58.680 --> 07:00.680
Just give me my order,
只要给我我的订单，

07:00.749 --> 07:03.887
or you'll know the meaning
of fear!
不然你就会知道其中的意义
恐惧！

07:03.956 --> 07:05.956
[whistles]
Security!
[口哨声]
安全！

07:06.025 --> 07:08.439
We got a small problem here.
我们这里遇到了一个小问题。

07:08.508 --> 07:10.301
<i>[light music]</i>
<i>[轻音乐]</i>

07:10.370 --> 07:11.784
Oh?
哦？

07:11.853 --> 07:13.370
Ahh!
[grunting]
啊！
[咕噜声]

07:13.439 --> 07:15.128
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

07:15.197 --> 07:16.922
[all grumbling]
- So boring.
[大家都在抱怨]
- 太无聊了。

07:16.991 --> 07:18.680
Short legs.
We should've known better.
腿短。
我们应该更清楚。

07:18.749 --> 07:20.059
I'm starving here!
我这里快饿死了！

07:20.128 --> 07:22.025
What are the chances
he gets our food?
有什么机会
他得到我们的食物吗？

07:22.094 --> 07:24.163
Slim to none, I'm guessing.
我猜，瘦到没有。

07:24.232 --> 07:25.439
Hello?
你好？

07:25.508 --> 07:26.646
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:26.715 --> 07:29.611
Could somebody help me
with this?
有人可以帮助我吗
与这个？

07:29.680 --> 07:32.577
[all munching]
[全都在咀嚼]

07:32.646 --> 07:36.749
Oh, and extra Evil sauce.
哦，还有额外的邪恶酱。

07:36.818 --> 07:37.922
- Wicked.
- Awesome.
- 邪恶的。
- 惊人的。

07:37.991 --> 07:41.335
A Weenie toast
to Captain Pipsqueak.
维尼吐司
皮普斯奎克船长。

07:41.404 --> 07:43.094
all: Pip pip hooray!
全体： 皮皮皮万岁！

07:43.163 --> 07:45.784
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:45.853 --> 07:47.128
Okay, Cap,
好吧，卡普，

07:47.197 --> 07:49.784
take this bag of snail droppings
拿走这袋蜗牛粪便

07:49.853 --> 07:52.059
and leave it
on that doorstep over there.
并留下它
就在那边的门口。

07:52.128 --> 07:54.197
It's the house of the Foot.
这是脚的房子。

07:54.266 --> 07:58.301
He's a superhero do-gooder
who deserves our worst.
他是一位超级英雄、行善者
谁该承受我们最坏的惩罚。

07:58.370 --> 07:59.404
Go!
去！

07:59.473 --> 08:02.439
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

08:02.508 --> 08:04.680
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:04.749 --> 08:06.749
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:06.818 --> 08:09.301
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

08:09.370 --> 08:13.404
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:13.473 --> 08:15.542
Yes.
[cackles]
是的。
[咯咯笑]

08:15.611 --> 08:16.853
I added a little
我加了一点

08:16.922 --> 08:19.818
of my own special Chum Mix
to the bag.
我自己的特殊密友混合
到袋子里。

08:19.887 --> 08:22.956
Captain Pipsqueak,
welcome to E.V.I.L.,
皮普斯奎克船长，
欢迎来到 E.V.I.L.，

08:23.025 --> 08:24.715
which stands for...
它代表...

08:24.784 --> 08:27.508
"Every Villain Is Lemons."
“每个恶棍都是柠檬。”

08:27.577 --> 08:28.715
- Yeah!
- Whoo!
- 是的！
- 呼！

08:28.784 --> 08:31.163
So Captain Pipsqueak,
what's next?
所以皮普斯奎克船长，
接下来会发生什么？

08:31.232 --> 08:32.301
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

08:32.370 --> 08:36.370
Follow me to world domination!
跟随我，称霸世界！

08:36.439 --> 08:37.784
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

08:37.853 --> 08:41.611
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:41.680 --> 08:43.025
- Huh?
- [laughs]
- 啊？
- [笑]

08:43.094 --> 08:45.197
[gasps]
Mr. Krabs!
[喘气]
蟹老板！

08:45.266 --> 08:46.749
- What now, boy?
- [groans]
- 现在怎么办，孩子？
- [呻吟]

08:46.818 --> 08:48.818
Shiver me's lumbers!
颤抖我的木头！

08:48.887 --> 08:51.266
<i>[upbeat jazzy music]</i>
<i>[欢快的爵士乐]</i>

08:51.335 --> 08:53.956
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

08:54.025 --> 08:56.232
Yah!
[laughs]
啊！
[笑]

08:56.301 --> 08:58.887
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

08:58.956 --> 09:00.232
Heh, heh.
呵呵。

09:00.301 --> 09:01.335
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

09:01.404 --> 09:02.853
[customers gasping]
[顾客喘气]

09:02.922 --> 09:04.680
[laughs]
[笑]

09:04.749 --> 09:08.232
You might as well give us
the secret formula now, Krabs.
你不妨给我们
现在秘密配方，蟹蟹。

09:08.301 --> 09:11.680
I'm the new mastermind
of E.V.I.L.
我是新的主谋
E.V.I.L. 的

09:11.749 --> 09:13.094
[laughs]
[笑]

09:13.163 --> 09:15.818
What, you nerds going
to a comic convention?
什么，你们这些书呆子要去
参加漫画大会？

09:15.887 --> 09:18.370
Ooh, that is a nice costume, Plankton.
哦，这服装真不错，痞游生物。

09:18.439 --> 09:19.680
[laughs]
[笑]

09:19.749 --> 09:22.749
The name is Captain Pipsqueak
to you.
我的名字是皮普斯奎克船长
给你。

09:22.818 --> 09:24.749
Get 'em!
- [laughs]
抓住他们！
- [笑]

09:24.818 --> 09:26.922
- Whoa, whoa!
- [gasps]
- 哇，哇！
- [喘气]

09:26.991 --> 09:28.508
[muffled]
- Dirty Bubble?
[低声]
- 肮脏的泡泡？

09:28.577 --> 09:30.611
But I just did my laundry.
但我刚刚洗完衣服。

09:30.680 --> 09:31.784
Thieves!
小偷！

09:31.853 --> 09:33.439
Keep yer filthy, rotten mitts
保留你肮脏、腐烂的手套

09:33.508 --> 09:35.473
offa me formular.
奥法我公式。

09:35.542 --> 09:37.163
[laughs]
[笑]

09:37.232 --> 09:39.887
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:39.956 --> 09:42.094
[laughs]
Yes.
[笑]
是的。

09:42.163 --> 09:43.508
Yes!
是的！

09:43.577 --> 09:46.266
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

09:46.335 --> 09:47.646
Huh?
啊？

09:47.715 --> 09:50.680
This isn't the formula
for world domination.
这不是公式
为了统治世界。

09:50.749 --> 09:53.059
It's a recipe for a sandwich!
这是三明治的食谱！

09:53.128 --> 09:54.922
How does that work?
这是如何运作的？

09:54.991 --> 09:59.715
Uh, well, with that,
I can put this guy...
呃，好吧，有了这个，
我可以把这个人...

09:59.784 --> 10:01.301
- [growls]
- Outta business.
- [咆哮]
- 没生意了。

10:01.370 --> 10:03.266
Mmm, why would we
ever wanna do that?
嗯，我们为什么要
有想过这样做吗？

10:03.335 --> 10:05.404
These Krabby Patties
taste great!
这些蟹肉饼
味道好极了！

10:05.473 --> 10:06.956
Yeah, mmm.
是的，嗯。

10:07.025 --> 10:08.784
- [spits]
- Mmm.
- [吐口水]
- 嗯。

10:08.853 --> 10:10.542
[chewing]
[咀嚼]

10:10.611 --> 10:13.370
- Mmm.
- Mmm.
- 嗯。
- 嗯。

10:13.439 --> 10:15.784
Here you go, boss.
Sorry about that.
给你，老板。
对此感到抱歉。

10:15.853 --> 10:17.301
Keep up the good work.
继续做好工作。

10:17.370 --> 10:19.853
I can't believe
this lousy pipsqueak...
我不敢相信
这个可恶的小吱吱……

10:19.922 --> 10:21.853
- Huh?
- Wasted our time!
- 啊？
- 浪费了我们的时间！

10:21.922 --> 10:24.680
- Some criminal genius he is.
- Right?
- 他是个犯罪天才。
- 正确的？

10:24.749 --> 10:28.163
"Massive evil intellect,"
my eye.
“巨大的邪恶智力，”
我的眼睛。

10:28.232 --> 10:30.715
- Nyah! <i>
- Holy habanero!</i>
- 呀！ <我>
- 神圣的哈瓦那！</i>

10:30.784 --> 10:32.611
<i>Is Plankton forever doomed</i>
<i>浮游生物是否永远注定要灭亡</i>

10:32.680 --> 10:34.749
<i>to be bound by a bottle?</i>
<i>被瓶子束缚？</i>

10:34.818 --> 10:36.646
- Ahh! <i>
- Grounded in glass?</i>
- 啊！ <我>
- 接地玻璃？</i>

10:36.715 --> 10:37.922
<i>No!</i>
- Ahh, ahh!
<i>不！</i>
- 啊啊啊！

10:37.991 --> 10:40.611
<i>Enveloped by extra Evil sauce!</i>
<i>被额外的邪恶酱汁包围！</i>

10:40.680 --> 10:42.887
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:42.956 --> 10:46.404
No outside condiments!
没有外面的调味品！

10:46.473 --> 10:47.508
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:47.577 --> 10:48.749
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

10:48.818 --> 10:51.439
Well, this stinks.
嗯，这很臭。

10:51.508 --> 10:52.853
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

<i>♪♪</i>